+; A volume named UP-Term (the kit's own disk, mounted by that name) clashes
+; with the UP-Term: assign the install makes: UP-Term: then means the disk.
+(if (<> (getassign "UP-Term" "v") "")
+    (abort "A volume named UP-Term is mounted, and it clashes with the UP-Term: assign.\n"
+           "Rename the disk (or the kit's drawer volume) and start Install again."))
+
